    "content" : "Observe that Aκ(X) does not necessarily contains a faithful X-module. For instance, if X has ℵ1 coarsely connected components, no coarse X-module of rank ℵ0 can be faithful. However, it is possible to fully characterise the cardinals for which the approximable category contains a faithful module."
