      "font" : "CMBX10",
      "font size" : 9.963,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Lemma 2.10. Let X be a LFCM space with an inﬁnite discrete partition. For any two discrete",
      "kids" : [ {
        "type" : "paragraph",
        "pdfua_tag" : "P",
        "id" : 1,
