        "content" : "partitions {Ai}i∈I and {Bj}j∈J, the cardinalities of I and J are equal. Moreover, for an inﬁnite cardinal κ, the following statements are equivalent:"
      }, {
        "type" : "list",
        "pdfua_tag" : "L",
        "id" : 2,
        "level" : "2",
        "page number" : 1,
        "bounding box" : [ 82.2, 614.208, 414.24, 648.711 ],
